      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "\"Less necessary\" means finding a way to make the machine stop demanding your entire existence. This isn't about quitting your job; it's about finding a way to gently detach your self-worth from the endless cycle of obligation. You can start by making small, deliberate choices that prioritize your own quiet, internal needs over the external demands. Sometimes, the most radical act is simply choosing to stop participating so fully.",
